  "result": "Done! I've added line discount support to the invoicing system:\n\n**Line Discounts:**\n- Lines can now have an optional `discountPercent` field (0-100, including decimals like 12.5)\n- `createInvoice` and `addLine` accept and validate `discountPercent`\n- Validation returns `DISCOUNT_INVALID` for values outside 0-100 or non-numeric input\n\n**Updated `invoiceTotals`:**\n- Now returns `{ subtotal, discount, total }` instead of just `{ subtotal, total }`\n- Calculates discount per line as `lineTotal \u00d7 discountPercent / 100`, rounded using `roundCents()`\n- Total = subtotal - discount\n- All amounts clamped to \u2265 0\n\n**Added tests:**\n- 13 comprehensive tests covering discount validation, calculation with single/multiple lines, decimal percentages, clamping, and addLine behavior\n\nAll 84 tests pass \u2713",
